# API Configuration for Mobile Access
# For local development on PC, leave as: http://localhost:5000
# For mobile access, set to your PC's IP address, e.g.: http://192.168.1.100:5000
# To find your PC's IP address:
# - Windows: Open Command Prompt and run "ipconfig"
# - Look for "IPv4 Address" under your network adapter
# - It will be something like 192.168.1.XXX

API_URL=http://localhost:5000
